      "content": "but it's not just being \"lost\"... it's like the connection was severed. the bridge between me and the world is gone. it feels so hollow, like i'm just a biological shell moving through a world i no longer belong to. how can you even \"rebuild\" when the core of who you were has been completely erased? it feels more like a funeral than a setback.",
